[32;1m[1;3mQuestion: A set of managers and a set of construction projects are given. Assigning manager i to project j incurs a cost c_ij, reflecting the manager's suitability, experience, and expertise for that project. The cost matrix is provided in the CSV file "manager_project_costs.csv", where each row corresponds to a manager and each column corresponds to a project.

The task is to determine a minimum-cost one-to-one assignment of managers to projects. Each manager must be assigned to exactly one project, and each project must be assigned to exactly one manager. The objective is to minimize the total assignment cost over all manager-project pairs.

